ces of  $△{X}^{′}{Y}^{′}{Z}^{′}$, the image of $△XYZ$ under the action of $T?$\n\n${X}^{′}($ \n{{field-1}}, \n{{field-2}}\n$),\\,$  $\\,{Y}^{′}($ \n{{field-3}}, \n{{field-4}}\n$),\\,$ $\\,{Z}^{′}($ \n{{field-5}}, \n{{field-6}}\n$)$" :question/worked-solution "To find the image of $△XYZ$ under the action of $T$, we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of $XYZ:$\n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -12 & 4 \\\\ 4 & -2 & 8\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of $△{X}^{′}{Y}^{′}{Z}^{′}$ are ${X}^{′}(2,4),$\n${Y}^{′}(-12,-2),$ ${Z}^{′}(4,8).$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186283505 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7c9849b9-397b-5fb9-bb4b-01f3d013c5c2" :knowledge-point/title "Computing the Image of a Polygon Under the Action of a Linear Transformation"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3091878b-bde2-5491-bd23-9e0670fc0ee1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186283507}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3091878b-bde2-5491-bd23-9e0670fc0ee1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186283507} :answer-field/id #uuid "a45002c2-d558-5b5d-b080-d13545b04065" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186283506} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7f533407-5ea2-5dae-bed8-0223210b59eb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186283509}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7f533407-5ea2-5dae-bed8-0223210b59eb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer